               and Siddiqui, H I and Siebert, A and Siltala, L and Silvelo, A
               and Slezak, E and Slezak, I and Smart, R L and Snaith, O N and
               Solano, E and Solitro, F and Souami, D and Souchay, J and
               Spagna, A and Spina, L and Spoto, F and Steele, I A and
               Steidelm{\"u}ller, H and Stephenson, C A and S{\"u}veges, M and
               Surdej, J and Szabados, L and Szegedi-Elek, E and Taris, F and
               Taylor, M B and Teixeira, R and Tolomei, L and Tonello, N and
               Torra, F and Torra, J and Torralba Elipe, G and Trabucchi, M and
               Tsounis, A T and Turon, C and Ulla, A and Unger, N and Vaillant,
               M V and van Dillen, E and van Reeven, W and Vanel, O and
               Vecchiato, A and Viala, Y and Vicente, D and Voutsinas, S and
